                            "thread_id": "cotester_thread_v2_6aab40751e888193b8738df81b4e1ed40bcc474c9204c954",
                            "user_id": "1",
                            "message": "I was unable to find information related to \"click on India\" or the specific action of selecting India as a country in the uploaded files. If you provide more context—such as the application name, user journey, or the specific behavior expected when clicking on India—I can generate accurate and structured manual test cases for you.\n\nPlease clarify:\n- Is this for a country selection dropdown?\n- Is there supposed to be a map or list to select India from?\n- What should happen after clicking on \"India\"?\n\nWith this information, I can deliver precise test cases per your requirements.",
