                            "user_id": "1",
                            "message": "There are still no specific details regarding an \"India\" button or its functionality in the uploaded files. \n\nTo write a relevant manual test case, please confirm:\n- Is there a button labeled \"India\" in your application?\n- What is the intended outcome or action when this button is clicked (e.g., navigate to a new page, display country info, update user profile)?\n- Which module or screen is this button located on?\n\nWith a bit more context, I can generate the exact test case you need.",
