                            "tc_id": "618",
                            "thread_id": "cotester_thread_v2_6aab40751e888193b8738df81b4e1ed40bcc474c9204c954",
                            "user_id": "1",
                            "message": "Thank you for clarifying that this is for the \"countries.apk\" app.\n\nSince there are no further details available about the behavior of the \"India\" button from the available data, I will proceed with a general manual test case for clicking the \"India\" button within a country selection feature. If you have more specific requirements or expected outcomes, please let me know to further tailor the test case.\n\n---\n\nTest Case: 1\n\nTest Case Title: Verify functionality of the \"India\" country selection button\n\nModule: Country Selection\n\nPriority: Medium\n\nPreconditions:\n- User has successfully launched the \"countries.apk\" app.\n- User is on the screen displaying the list or grid of country buttons.\n\nTest Steps:\n1. Locate the button labeled \"India\" among the list of countries.\n2. Click the \"India\" button.\n3. Observe the application response upon clicking the button.\n\nExpected Result:\n- The application performs the expected action (such as navigating to details about India, marking India as selected, or displaying information related to India).\n- The correct country details, flag, or associated content for India are visible without errors.\n- No UI glitches or unexpected behavior occur after the button is clicked.\n\n---\n\nPlease specify if you want a different expected behavior or more detailed steps based on what the \"India\" button is supposed to do in your app.",
